  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "In 1996 in Varginha, a town in Brazil, an unknown craft is said to have crashed and a living creature is said to have been captured, and Brazil's former defence minister Aldo Rebelo, now a presidential candidate, says it really happened. In his own interview with Michels, Rebelo says: \"The phenomenon existed. It was there. The objects were there. The creature was seen.\" Michels, who travelled to Brazil to interview him, later sums up Rebelo's answer as \"Yeah, this happened\", treating it as an unusual confirmation from a senior official."
